Source: minti-pack-wiki-simple
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MINTI Project <minti@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: minti-pack-wiki-simple
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 minti-pack-fetch (>= 0.1),
 kiwix-tools,
 ca-certificates
Description: MINTI addon — Simple English Wikipedia (offline)
 Downloads a Simple English Wikipedia ZIM snapshot (~1.5 GB) to
 /var/lib/minti/wiki/ and starts kiwix-serve on 127.0.0.1:8888 (LAN
 invisible by default; Clan members reach it via the minti-mcp-wiki
 MCP server, not raw HTTP).
 .
 First-tier knowledge addon — fits comfortably even on the 8 GB RAM /
 40 GB disk test VM. Heavier tiers (full English no-pic ~50 GB,
 top-50k with pics ~20 GB) will arrive as separate packs
 (minti-pack-wiki-en, minti-pack-wiki-en-top).
 .
 Postinst calls `minti-pack-fetch wiki-simple`. Set MINTI_PACK_NO_FETCH=1
 in the environment when installing to defer the download — the operator
 then runs `sudo minti-pack-fetch wiki-simple` when bandwidth allows.
 .
 The ZIM filename and SHA-256 in /usr/share/minti/packs/wiki-simple/manifest.json
 are pinned to a known-good snapshot; refresh them periodically per
 https://download.kiwix.org/zim/wikipedia/.
